# Hello World — macOS builder

This is a platform build workspace, not the app's main project. The canonical
project lives on the server at `__REMOTE_PROJECT_DISPLAY__`.

- `./platform sync` replaces `macos/` with the source from the server.
- `./platform build` compiles universal macOS artifacts locally.
- `./platform publish` builds and sends only those compiled artifacts back to
  the canonical project, which redeploys the app.

Edit the canonical source over SSH (directly or with a coding agent), sync it
here, then publish it from this Mac.
